{
  "category": "Symbol Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Their shapes look like hieroglyphs on ancient tab lets. It is said that the two are somehow related.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its flat, thin body is always stuck on walls. Its shape appears to have some meaning.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because different types of UNOWN exist, it is said that they must have a variety of abilities.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "This POKéMON is shaped like ancient writing. It is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various UNOWN. Research into this topic is ongoing but nothing is known.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "This POKéMON is shaped like ancient writing. It is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various UNOWN. Research into this topic is ongoing but nothing is known.",
